# S25: Mobile-Responsive UX + PWA

## Objective

Make work-control and todo usable on mobile. PWA: installable on iOS/Android,
offline-capable for read-only views. Board on mobile: vertical stacked columns
(swipe to switch). Chat on mobile: full-screen thread. Keyboard palette (S20)
adapted to touch (bottom sheet command bar).

## Features

- Responsive board: vertical columns on `sm:`, horizontal on `lg:`
- Chat: full-screen on mobile, no sidebar
- Bottom navigation bar on mobile (Home / Chats / Board / Profile)
- PWA: `@vite-pwa/nuxt` or `nuxt-pwa`, manifest, service worker
- Offline: cache last-viewed chat + board; show stale data with banner
- Push notifications (Web Push) for gate.opened + task.done events

## Tasks

- [ ] S25-T01-FreezeInvariants.pd
- [ ] S25-T02-ResponsiveBoard.pd        — vertical stack on mobile, swipe nav
- [ ] S25-T03-ResponsiveChat.pd         — full-screen mobile chat, bottom nav
