- [ ] S25-T08-KnowledgeUpdate.pd        — pwa + mobile slugs
- [ ] S25-T09-TestsSmoke.pd             — Lighthouse PWA audit ≥90

## Definition of Done

- [ ] Lighthouse PWA score ≥90 on work-control
- [ ] Board usable on 375px viewport (iPhone SE)
- [ ] App installable (Add to Home Screen works)
- [ ] Offline: last-viewed board loads without network
- [ ] `bun run test` green

